# Retired packages, except the MATLAB the counterfactual package ports or
# cites: the Figure Five likelihood analysis (H / S simulation, model
# helpers), the Figure One behavioral model helpers (Postdictive, First-only,
# Total Time, ...) and the Weber-fraction loader. Git cannot re-include a
# file under an ignored directory, so each level is re-opened in turn.
